{"3931960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nightcrawler", "steam_appid": 3931960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightcrawler</strong> is a minimalist retrowave arcade about the state of flow.<br>You get an endless road, a sunset, and synthwave. The game sets one clear rule: stay on track and pass through the gates. Miss one — the run is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How it works</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clipping zones:</strong> align your path and pass through the gates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic difficulty:</strong> the longer you ride, the faster the road and the narrower the gaps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure focus:</strong> no distractions — just you, the motorcycle, and the rhythm of the road.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> neon aesthetics and a synthwave soundtrack create a meditative yet intense flow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game offers</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Endless road with meditative gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Atmospheric synthwave soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Neon, sunset, and retrofuturistic aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple controls — relax and enjoy the ride.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightcrawler</strong> is a minimalist retrowave arcade about the state of flow.<br>You get an endless road, a sunset, and synthwave. The game sets one clear rule: stay on track and pass through the gates. Miss one — the run is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How it works</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clipping zones:</strong> align your path and pass through the gates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 